6f81ed323663","maturity":"draft","page_type":"entity","path":"pages/entities/deepagent-ltd-deepagent-code-6f81ed323663.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":[],"title":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_02bfd67211e541db19d07f1dea0d607b7eb65749e2da63599f7027bba43f32c8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"For high-risk decisions an Expert Panel reviews a frozen question through correctness, security, performance, architecture, and reproducibility lenses, debating anonymously up to three rounds before a deterministic arbiter that preserves minority opinions and fails closed to human review."},{"claim_ids":["clm_23081dd23f39173f016b8f9cf5aba564230e7a1160bbb8ba433677875c1df6ef"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The preset MCP catalog derives risk tiers from the catalog template rather than user config, and servers default to not-connected with write and external-fetch operations behind approval gates."},{"claim_ids":["clm_28e6d3a3240321e8276a3f13a1f7554d883fa3ece3870444b9e4f00ede23033f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Persistent state lives in typed documents (knowledge, strategy, methodology, skill, memory, design, worklog, diagnosis, eval) linked via supports/blocks/conflicts/validates into a traversable graph, with scope layers from session-private to sealed audit-only material."},{"claim_ids":["clm_54771ee885d68ccc5c4750792639e52ed121b90a3747c4cefdade68ee4b46554"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product ships as a desktop app and a terminal CLI; the CLI supports `deepagent auth login`, `deepagent auth list`, and `deepagent-code run \"<task>\"`."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6673651db53f53de51238100a758a96a3f38c7e41a8c8393ddbbb68db52363a0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project builds with Bun 1.3.14 and is provider-agnostic, supporting 75+ providers via the AI SDK and models.dev plus any OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible endpoint."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6f658f2e0cb6000519a44b1de0a87934e4d06e6efca5fbb06f28fa916f986ba4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later and is derived from opencode under the MIT License with NOTICE attribution; an enterprise edition exists in a separate repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7d43ca997771a9a73ee3c124ea1adc7cbe2163bb18489bbc320cbff4a5d384b4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Context assembly uses a durable Context Epoch: stable system instructions stay byte-stable for prompt caching while volatile state is appended in a dedicated tail block, and context changes are admitted only at safe provider-turn boundaries."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8816eb9058ae23b4ed3f99e85eb7a97a840410ca9c21a66301dc83963196c4aa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Write-capable subagents get dedicated worktrees and return compact summaries; a Reviewer session checks each exact worker SHA, the coordinator performs serial `--no-ff` merges, and generation fencing prevents stale workers from settling or overwriting newer work."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b526bd398a1ba102298cf99934337f3e19584661910112bc7809b387e1303448"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Providers are configured in `~/.deepagent/code/config.jsonc`; a custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint can set `discovery: true` for runtime model refresh or list models explicitly under `models`."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b6a1fe8e96f4337e9ffba6228b83f5e6bd7ee541dc29d05ef11e2270d79f2487"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The `deepagent-code` npm package is not yet publicly published; installation is via the desktop app or a curl install script."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ccccd1d6a08d85c7d54bac050862c7777dc5632dd5833efc4b91ae7ac3c3a7f0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Learning follows a governed lifecycle: evidence creates a candidate, isolated review or human decision changes its status, and regression/ablation gates publish a reproducible knowledge snapshot; rejection reasons persist so discarded patterns are not silently relearned."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ead25eab29b929c50ad91e7a5f2755df919d8dabba2ead37f599a5f7f32eb0a9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Three collaboration modes are offered: Auto (end-to-end execution), Loop (editable `goal+plan.md` advanced through plan, execute, verify, iterate ticks), and Design (faithful execution of a user-written plan); autonomy and permission levels are independent of mode."}],"claim_ids":["clm_02bfd67211e541db19d07f1dea0d607b7eb65749e2da63599f7027bba43f32c8","clm_23081dd23f39173f016b8f9cf5aba564230e7a1160bbb8ba433677875c1df6ef","clm_28e6d3a3240321e8276a3f13a1f7554d883fa3ece3870444b9e4f00ede23033f","clm_54771ee885d68ccc5c4750792639e52ed121b90a3747c4cefdade68ee4b46554","clm_6673651db53f53de51238100a758a96a3f38c7e41a8c8393ddbbb68db52363a0","clm_6f658f2e0cb6000519a44b1de0a87934e4d06e6efca5fbb06f28fa916f986ba4","clm_7d43ca997771a9a73ee3c124ea1adc7cbe2163bb18489bbc320cbff4a5d384b4","clm_8816eb9058ae23b4ed3f99e85eb7a97a840410ca9c21a66301dc83963196c4aa","clm_b526bd398a1ba102298cf99934337f3e19584661910112bc7809b387e1303448","clm_b6a1fe8e96f4337e9ffba6228b83f5e6bd7ee541dc29d05ef11e2270d79f2487","clm_ccccd1d6a08d85c7d54bac050862c7777dc5632dd5833efc4b91ae7ac3c3a7f0","clm_ead25eab29b929c50ad91e7a5f2755df919d8dabba2ead37f599a5f7f32eb0a9"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c","id":"pg_2f740df261f454dda68a55b236ad0a49","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/deepagent-ltd-deepagent-code-readme-md-57be03002bc4-55b236ad0a49.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_448ea9efc95653d1a54d8255e0154afb"],"title":"deepagent-ltd/deepagent-code/README.md @ 57be03002bc4","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:45:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a2876b83115d46e295c286de75c2e88c"}
